# Smash the Orcish Scouts (San d'Oria 1-1): the sections that do not apply. Main, a level 10 Warrior of Bastok holding
# an Orcish Axe and no mission, in Southern San d'Oria: Endracion: not a San d'Orian: no section; the axe traded: his
# script's 1010. bob, a level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with Bat Hunt current (a GM): Endracion: 1-1's sections fail
# (another mission current): Bat Hunt's own section answers; the axe traded: his script's 1008 (Bat Hunt wants the
# Orcish Scale Mail).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrade
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
char bob zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Sandoria BatHunt current
item OrcishAxe
bob: item OrcishAxe
login
trigger Endracion                       # not a San d'Orian: no section: his script's default
finish option=0
walk -109.5,1,-34
trade Endracion OrcishAxe x1            # no section 3: his script's 1010
bob: login
bob: trigger Endracion                  # another mission current: Bat Hunt's 1021
bob: finish option=0
bob: walk -109.5,1,-34
bob: trade Endracion OrcishAxe x1       # his script's 1008
